 scope and diff.patch are measured from 49a5bac1. The owner's uncommitted build files (xtask sources, Cargo.lock, the Tauri manifests, the desktop-core version bump, the harness pin, the legacy feature views) are present as uncommitted copies, excluded from scope as the owner's work. Native acceptance C40-N01..N02 recorded against the rebuilt fixture bundle (native-prepare.json; executable hash bound in native-acceptance.json) with AX trees, self-captures and the measured layout matrix under evidence/C40/screens. The owner's dependency amendment of 2026-10-30 applies (approved in the owner's words, \"Dependency amendment approved\"): P09 chunks are reviewed on their own worktrees from each predecessor's pre-gate commit; predecessor remediation is integrated by the merge chain and validated by the P09 phase review, so a chunk's review takes the predecessor's record as it stands.",
